{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cf3f956732d3fefce8278370e3a1f3b08c44284236bdbb42f514454aba8206b7", "ja": "（今日は、海美のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影だ。\n本番前、共演するウサギ達に会いに行ってきた……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄海美的角色扮演写真企划。正式拍摄前，我去见了见一起出演的兔子们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "1cd2cfe613a7ea42ab3dd01536190f21551eb2d1adeb932c3eb26037a01b4b60", "ja": "{$P$}、見た！？\nみんなすっごくカワイかったよね～！", "zh": "{$P$}，你看到了吗！？\n大家都超级可爱的吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "014922da4a463c26fdb2d58e22a1532bef41f561881323a47124952e08d54a62", "ja": "特に茶色い子！　膝に乗ってきたと思ったら\nそのまま座って、寝始めちゃって……うう～！", "zh": "尤其是那只棕色的！本以为它会跳到膝盖上，结果就那么坐着，开始睡起来了……呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bb8abe23bba570de2e2ed99b5015e20e61e8219d24c7b17d1b1bee8795816a02", "ja": "ははっ、あのウサギは海美が大好きみたいだったな。\nいやー。ウサギを見てたら癒やされたよ。", "zh": "哈哈，那只兔子好像很喜欢海美啊。\n哎呀——看着兔子，感觉都被治愈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "5749c64877da50eebf2effac42d75973e0e192d4a245bdfedc8820f997fd3106", "ja": "だよね～！　それでね、{$P$}。\n私、気づいちゃったんだ……。", "zh": "就是嘛～！然后啊，{$P$}。\n我突然发现了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "c1d4df6c630bb42ea1d5f131408d76990131dc4bf73022da359c29c7a4ac2afe", "ja": "ウサギって、本当にカワイイよねっ！", "zh": "兔子真的很可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c01865a71a5a4d298e1e051b7795ebe41156a57c1ec361c376da27647aa275ed", "ja": "うん、そうだな。", "zh": "嗯，没错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "8f38986d04d91888196a7560c54065d0ae3fa55700c35bc687b95f8593909bf6", "ja": "ちょっとした動きで、\nみんなをトリコにしちゃうよねっ！", "zh": "只要稍微动一动，就能把大家迷得神魂颠倒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ded9407a9c6c6506a3f782a0d08627023f72f819b77d66a7b4b7b758e3c65573", "ja": "……そうかもしれないな。", "zh": "……或许是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "48d029c76c89034471a2a089f8a68d7d69749e815fe5b7eeb011e52fde3f285b", "ja": "きっとね……これが女子力なんだよ！", "zh": "一定是……这就是所谓的女子力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0e6276d0ed869228b7ba1a7b394e55c70c9bf266d869179d7c98cbb869cc770a", "ja": "女子力……。", "zh": "女子力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "c1057f261b50cdc1001c43b9d7a60708529e04c3d7423f8bb844d84ff47c2263", "ja": "うん。ウサギって、小さくてふわふわしてて、\nなんだか守ってあげたくなるでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。兔子小小的、毛茸茸的，不知怎么就让人想保护它，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "f6d1ab5fdb8d2feca81c2e8505842f4338fa9f57c33e94af25779d231e8f6a5b", "ja": "それって、まさに女子力のお手本なんだよ！\nこの前読んだ、女子力高めの雑誌に書いてあったの。", "zh": "那正是女性魅力的典范啊！\n我之前看过的那本介绍高女性魅力的杂志上就是这么写的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "aee1211259904639a631d2e8b3414bc065c13aa7a552171fd1904a15116812e2", "ja": "な、なるほど……。今日の撮影で、\n女子力の一部を学べるかもしれないってことか。", "zh": "原、原来如此……也就是说，今天的拍摄或许能学到提升女性魅力的一部分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "15398fd0dd98f7ccfd3ce6f38bad36bdde2de43a430dc869e4b9ca807fb663f8", "ja": "そういうこと♪　ウサギをお手本にすれば、\n女子力アップも夢じゃない！", "zh": "就是这样♪ 以兔子为榜样的话，提升女生魅力也不是梦想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "8af8e9947232ae2d191bcfd86172e4bd7c27978f0ac7efe79023fb0d67a5caa3", "ja": "{$P$}、見てて。必ず女子力を\n会得してみせるから！　よーし、頑張るぞーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，看好了。我一定要掌握提升女性魅力的方法！好——加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0563_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c7d58a2ba386dbc7e1f8e896babb04334f5bd201e996c5371b49221894738b3f", "ja": "（意気込んだ海美だが、ウサギ達との撮影を思いきり\n楽しんでいた。……ウサギの前では、そうなるよな）", "zh": "（海美虽然干劲十足，但和兔子们一起拍摄时玩得特别开心。……在兔子面前，确实会变成这样啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
